Probable frequencies of tuning fork be $n \pm$ 5
Frequency of sonometer wire, $n \propto \frac{1}{l}$
$$
\begin{aligned}
&\therefore \frac{n+5}{n-5}=\frac{100}{95} \Rightarrow 95(n+5)=100(n-5) \\
&\text { or, } 95 n+475=100 n-500 \\
&\text { or, } 5 n=975 \\
&\text { or, } n=\frac{975}{5}=195 \mathrm{~Hz}
\end{aligned}
$$
